      "title": "About this workflow",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## CorridorKey 2.0: basic keying\n\nKeys a green/blue-screen clip with no settings to tune. The first run downloads the model (about 5 GB) into `models/corridorkey2`.\n\n**Your footage:** replace **Demo Clip** with **Load Video → Get Video Components** (or an image sequence loader) and connect its `images`. The Demo Clip is a synthetic green-screen shot with its exact matte, so every example runs without media.\n\n- **alpha_hint** (optional): a rough subject mask. One mask = hint on the first frame, one per frame = per-frame hint. White = subject.\n- **hint_quality**: how much to trust the hint (clean matte, rough matte, loose hint).\n- **despill**: removes screen colour from the foreground. Changing it re-runs the keyer; use the Despill node instead to tweak without re-keying.\n\nOutputs: straight sRGB foreground, alpha, and RGBA saved as a PNG sequence in `output/corridorkey2`."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "## CorridorKey 2.0: basic keying\n\nKeys a green/blue-screen clip with no settings to tune. The first run downloads the model (about 5 GB) into `models/corridorkey2`.\n\n**Your footage:** replace **Demo Clip** with **Load Video → Get Video Components** (or an image sequence loader) and connect its `images`. The Demo Clip is a synthetic green-screen shot with its exact matte, so every example runs without media.\n\n- **alpha_hint** (optional): a rough subject mask. One mask = hint on the first frame, one per frame = per-frame hint. White = subject.\n- **hint_quality**: how much to trust the hint (clean matte, rough matte, loose hint).\n- **despill**: removes screen colour from the foreground. Changing it re-runs the keyer; use the Despill node instead to tweak without re-keying.\n\nOutputs: straight sRGB foreground, alpha, and RGBA saved as a PNG sequence in `output/corridorkey2`."
      },
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    }
